{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>InfoRapid Sights 以地圖及擴增實境顯示身邊的地標、觀景點與拍照位置，適合城市漫步、攝影及自駕旅遊時尋找景點與規劃路線。此 App 原價 US $0.99，目前<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-193.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>地標探索與導覽規劃</h2>\n<p>開啟相機後，地標會以氣泡標示實景方向、圖片與距離；地圖可依星級篩選重要景點，並下載區域離線保存。你可按時間規劃步行、單車或駕車導覽，加入心儀地點並自動勾選到訪站點。拍照位置、黃金與藍色時刻、開放時間、建築特點及維基百科摘要均有助安排拍攝與行程。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-189-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-190-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-191-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-192-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-193-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-194-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：InfoRapid Sights</li><li>應用類別：Navigation</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/inforapid-sights/id1570911995?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T21:51:16.555462+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":281,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T21:37:23+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T23:05:38.992552+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T21:44:38.123852+00:00","content_hash":"2ce76a623e378486c10c4f27e27e4d1a74523e654203e0bb70c14179b94ea172","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}